  - part-of-speech features
  - WELFake
abstract: >-
  An XGBoost and TextCNN soft-voting ensemble over TF-IDF, part-of-speech ratio
  features and frozen GloVe embeddings, trained and served on CPU. The repository
  ships the ablations, leakage tests, efficiency benchmarks and paired
  significance tests behind the reported figures.
